HFP profile.

Origin: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libgnome-volume-control/-/merge_requests/31
Bug-GNOME: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libgnome-volume-control/-/issues/34
Bug-Ubuntu: https://bugs.launchpad.net/ubuntu/+source/wireplumber/+bug/2137545
